    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Star Ores Inc.</strong>\u2014where ore, robots, and the drive for money determine your success! Your career begins on an abandoned space station in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroid Mining</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your laser drill to extract ores from the asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/d77459260b5c07a1676d63d1ab7e18dd.poster.avif?t=1754561116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/d77459260b5c07a1676d63d1ab7e18dd.webm?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/d77459260b5c07a1676d63d1ab7e18dd.mp4?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation by Robots</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy robots to help you mine, transport, and sell ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/a80889b493bb12e1b4d996750ab69635.poster.avif?t=1754561116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/a80889b493bb12e1b4d996750ab69635.webm?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/a80889b493bb12e1b4d996750ab69635.mp4?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Ore and Maximize Your Profit</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell ore to intergalactic customers and strike it rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/7e8e7eaa67833962a0f428be60ea14e4.poster.avif?t=1754561116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/7e8e7eaa67833962a0f428be60ea14e4.webm?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/7e8e7eaa67833962a0f428be60ea14e4.mp4?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Space Station</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old station hides secrets! Remove growths, discover new areas, activate old terminals, and upgrade your laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/5fef72f7e3f51a041362a3948065b91c.poster.avif?t=1754561116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/5fef72f7e3f51a041362a3948065b91c.webm?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/5fef72f7e3f51a041362a3948065b91c.mp4?t=1754561116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your laser, bring the space station back to life, and become a legend of intergalactic mining. <strong>Your career begins NOW!</strong></p>",
